<section>
	<h2 id="footer">Footer</h2>
	<h3 id="footer-widgets">Footer Widgets</h3>
	<p>Add widgets in <b>Appearance &gt; Widgets &gt; Footer</b>. Adjust the footer widget columns and colors in <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; [PT] Theme Options &gt; Footer</b>.</p>
	<h3 id="bottom-footer">Bottom Footer</h3>
	<p>Set the left, center and right footer text in <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; [PT] Theme Options &gt; Footer</b>. The center field contains payment icons by default; replace or remove them to suit your site.</p>
</section>
